Customer Churn Prediction (Deep Learning)

This project uses a deep learning model to predict telecom customer churn. It includes data cleaning, feature engineering, model tuning, and SHAP explainability.

🧠 Techniques
- TensorFlow/Keras
- Binary Classification
- Feature Engineering
- Hyperparameter Tuning
- SHAP Explainability

📊 Dataset
- Telco Customer Churn Dataset (Kaggle)

🔍 Outcome
- Accuracy: 86%
- SHAP Visuals: Interpreted top predictors like contract type and tenure
